{"id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-set.md","title":"Set","display":"df-set — Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-set","aliases":["58-df-set"],"display":"df-set — Set","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-set — Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> (一阶 ZFC 的任意对象变量)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Set}_S(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Set}_S(x)\\)</span> (集合谓词；在一阶 ZFC 的单类论域中恒真)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Set}_S(x)\\leftrightarrow x=x\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Set}_S(x)\\leftrightarrow x=x\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>一阶 ZFC 只有一种对象：每个量词变量都取集合值，因此集合谓词是恒真谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 只可作为元语言中的真类记号，不能在 ZFC 对象语言中把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span> 当成普通成员关系公式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Set}_S(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Set}_S(x)\\leftrightarrow x=x","display":true},{"tex":"V","d